## Venv Activation

Always activate venv before running Python. Detect OS first:

- **PowerShell (Windows):** `.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1`
- **Git Bash / WSL / Linux:** `source .venv/bin/activate`

## Common Dev Commands (after venv)

```bash
# Install
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Test
python -m pytest kg_engine/tests/ -v

# Lint
ruff check kg_engine/

# Ingest data
python kg_engine/scripts/ingest_materials_kg.py --input path/to/data --ensure-schema
```

